@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Application and database health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Create a transaction (first account/payee use also raises NEW_PAYEE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-001",
  "payeeId": "PAYEE-A",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "transactionTime": "2026-08-05T09:00:00Z",
  "description": "Supplier invoice"
}

### Create a high-amount transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "ACC-001",
  "payeeId": "PAYEE-A",
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "transactionTime": "2026-08-05T09:01:00Z",
  "description": "High amount demonstration"
}

### Search and filter transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions?search=ACC-001&minAmount=100&page=0&size=20

### List open alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?status=OPEN&page=0&size=20

### Read alert details (replace 1 with an existing alert ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/1

### Acknowledge an alert
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetStatus": "ACKNOWLEDGED",
  "resolutionNotes": null
}

### Start investigation
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetStatus": "INVESTIGATING",
  "resolutionNotes": null
}

### Close an alert (terminal states require meaningful notes)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetStatus": "CLOSED",
  "resolutionNotes": "Reviewed and confirmed as a legitimate supplier payment"
}

### Read effective rule configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rules

### Read dashboard summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
